    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Cauliflower isa versatile, nutrient-dense cruciferous vegetable. It features a large, dense head of undeveloped flower buds called the \"curd,\" connected by a thick core and surrounded by large green leaves. While white is most common, it also comes in vibrant purple, orange, and green varieties.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">About 2.5-4 lbs each.</span></p>",
